# Agent deferred work → todos

When you leave real follow-up work (out of scope, blocked, or explicitly deferred), add one file under `.cursor/agent-todos/` using that folder's README format. Do not invent speculative todos.

If you hit an ambiguity while implementing a GitHub issue, stop and follow `.cursor/skills/workspace-agent-todo/SKILL.md` (comment questions, `needs-human`, do not guess).
